      "body": "<!-- markdownlint-disable -->\r\n\r\n## Overview\r\n\r\nThe FP8 variant still passes `--enable-mamba-fine-grained-prefix-cache`, renamed to `--enable-mamba-shared-prefix-checkpoint` in v0.31.0 (#57382). With the recipe's 0.31.0 floor, the FP8 command never parses.\r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\n\r\n```\r\nnode scripts/validate-source.mjs --source vllm --dir recipes   (vllm-project/recipes) → valid\r\nFP8 renderings in the generated JSON                          → old flag 0, new flag 8\r\ngrep -- --enable-mamba-shared-prefix-checkpoint vllm/engine/arg_utils.py  @v0.31.0, v0.32.0 → present\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary> Pull Request Checklist </summary>\r\n\r\n- [x] I used vLLM's `/pr-checklist` skill. \r\n- [x] AI assistance was used during the creation of this PR.\r\n\r\n- [ ] **Design Fit:**\r\n- [ ] **Testing and Validation:**\r\n- [ ] **Code Quality and Style:**\r\n- [ ] **Pull Request Contents:**\r\n</details>\r\n",
